# Ambient tooling that writes into the cwd (claude-flow/ruflo runtime state)
.claude-flow/

# graft: `graft init` writes per-machine wiring for Claude Code, Cursor and
# Gemini into the repo root - hardcoded absolute paths, plus an `npx -y` MCP
# server that would run for anyone who clones. Not for a zero-dependency repo.
# Regenerable any time with `graft init` / `graft build`.
/graft/
/.ignore
/.mcp.json
/AGENTS.md
/GEMINI.md
/.claude/settings.json
/.claude/helpers/graft-*.cjs
/.claude/skills/graft/
/.cursor/
/.gemini/
